  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "轴1 · 网关启动",
      "items": [
        "main → runCli → runServe → YamlConfig::load（内建 Taxonomy）；失败抛错，进程非 0 退出",
        "EventLoop 构造 Epoll 与 wakeup/timer Channel，再按成员序组装 Gateway 至 Pipeline(Deps)",
        "接线：setPost、HttpMcpBackend+Catalog::add、setOnListed、setCallback、setOnExpire；HttpMcp 构造不 listen",
        "start：refreshOnWorker → probeAllBlocking（失败记 Down 不抛）→ startListen 里 Acceptor/Socket::bind/listen → startTimer + runEvery → loop"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "轴2 · POST /mcp tools/call",
      "items": [
        "EventLoop::loop → acceptConnection → newConnection → attachToLoop → onConn(Session) → readFd → onMessage(llhttp)",
        "Origin/Bearer + authenticate + effectiveBump 组装 ir::Request，Pipeline::handle 开 tracer span",
        "handleCall：parse → authorizeCall → lookup → acquire → isOpen/state → insert → Call::startUpstream/fireAttempt",
        "worker keepAlivePost → classify → queueInLoop → onUpstream → shouldRetry → 可选 MemTaskStore → respond → erase + Permit 归还 → sendHttp"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "旁路与失败",
      "items": [
        "HttpMcp 短支：GET /healthz、GET /upstreams、Origin 403、401 auth_fail、非 /mcp 404（图中经 Session → Response）",
        "Pipeline 短支：tools/list（FacetView + visibilityFilter + shortestRemainingMs）、server/discover、tasks/get、tasks/cancel、handleBuiltin",
        "执行短支：InFlight hit、Admit::Reject、circuit OPEN、health Down、promote/attachTask",
        "SIGINT → Gateway::requestStop；bind/listen 失败抛错"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "右区值类型与测试夹具",
      "items": [
        "右侧集群列出接口 Policy/Backend/Governor/Health/Tracer 与 AgentCfg、GrantRecord、Permit、Waiter 等值类型",
        "不画 PrincipalForge、NullTracer、StubHealth、CountingBackend、HoldingBackend、CountingGovernor、PipeEnv"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
